    "If these common endpoints don't return a GraphQL response, you could also try appending [[C0]] to the path." => 'Jika jalur tersebut belum membalas respons GraphQL, coba tambahkan awalan atau akhiran versi seperti [[C0]].',
    'GraphQL services will often respond to any non-GraphQL request with a "query not present" or similar error. You should bear this in mind when testing for GraphQL endpoints.' => 'Pesan error seperti "query not present" saat menerima permintaan kosong juga merupakan petunjuk kuat keberadaan endpoint GraphQL.',
    'Request methods' => 'Metode permintaan',
