    'Probing for introspection' => 'Memeriksa status introspection',
    'It is best practice for introspection to be disabled in production environments, but this advice is not always followed.' => 'Walau praktik keamanan menyarankan agar introspection dimatikan di server produksi, banyak aplikasi tetap membiarkannya aktif.',
    'You can probe for introspection using the following simple query. If introspection is enabled, the response returns the names of all available queries.' => 'Uji apakah introspection aktif menggunakan kueri singkat berikut:',
