    'Running a full introspection query' => 'Menjalankan kueri introspection lengkap',
    'The next step is to run a full introspection query against the endpoint so that you can get as much information on the underlying schema as possible.' => 'Setelah terkonfirmasi aktif, jalankan kueri introspection penuh untuk mengunduh seluruh definisi tipe, kueri, mutasi, dan subskripsi.',
    'The example query below returns full details on all queries, mutations, subscriptions, types, and fragments.' => 'Contoh kueri berikut meminta seluruh detail struktur skema secara menyeluruh:',
    "If introspection is enabled but the above query doesn't run, try removing the [[C0]], [[C1]], and [[C2]] directives from the query structure. Many endpoints do not accept these directives as part of an introspection query, and you can often have more success with introspection by removing them." => 'Jika introspection aktif namun kueri gagal dieksekusi, hapus baris direktif [[C0]], [[C1]], dan [[C2]] karena banyak implementasi modern tidak menerimanya.',
    'Visualizing introspection results' => 'Memvisualisasikan hasil introspection',
