    'When developers disable introspection, they could use a regex to exclude the [[C0]] keyword in queries. You should try characters like spaces, new lines and commas, as they are ignored by GraphQL but not by flawed regex.' => 'Filter regex sederhana kerap hanya memblokir teks mentah [[C0]]; menambahkan spasi, koma, atau baris baru akan diabaikan parser GraphQL tetapi mengelabui regex.',
